<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Known fake-GPS / mock-location apps (D-OWNER-MDM-02, D-AINT-04). ONE place to update: add the package here AND as a
     <package> in the <queries> block of core-geo/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml (FakeGpsManifestDriftTest fails when the two
     differ, because Android hides a package that the manifest does not declare). This replaces QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES, which
     Google Play restricts to apps whose core purpose needs it; a sales app does not qualify. An app that is not on this list
     is still caught by the mock flag on the fix itself. Curated; extend it when a TSO reports a new one. -->
